# Local junction/symlink -> .agents/skills, so Claude Code can discover them.
# The skills themselves are tracked in .agents/skills; recreate with:
#   macOS/Linux: ln -s ../.agents/skills .claude/skills
#   Windows:     New-Item -ItemType Junction -Path .claude/skills -Target .agents/skills
